### 14. Validation errors always return every invalid field (data.errors)
### regardless of NODE_ENV: one { field, message, value } entry per rule.
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "a",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short"
}

